  "unitComposition": "<ul><li>1 Incursor Sergeant model</li>\\r<li>4-9 Incursor models</li></ul>\\rEvery model is equipped with: 1 Bolt Pistol; 1 Occulus Bolt Carbine; 1 Paired Combat Blades.",
